UXDuck: PX4 1.17.0's SITL freezes at 100% CPU when its timer queue gets a
loop in it under lockstep SIH, so the vehicle stops sending. Backported from
PX4's main branch, which fixed it after 1.17.0:

  a74f1da74c fix(drv_hrt): fix TSAN issues
  9b62a1701d fix(WorkQueue): fix lifetime race between Run() and destruction

Drop this patch when UXDuck builds a PX4 release that has both.

